name cooking-units
category Package
revision 63509
shortdesc Typeset and convert units for cookery books and recipes
longdesc The package provides commands to typeset amounts and units
longdesc consistently and offers an easy-to-use key-value syntax to
longdesc convert one unit into another (for example 'dag' to 'g'; see
longdesc the documentation for more examples). This packages requires
longdesc expl3 and xparse, translations, xfrac, l3keys2e, and,
longdesc optionally, fmtcount.
